ich[62Gis[65Gwhat[70Gyou[74Gasked[80Gabout.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1m1. Why it appeared twice[22m[K[2C[2BNot a bug in the packet builder — you registered[52Gthe[56Gsame[61Gscript[68Gtwice.[2C[2B[38;2;177;185;249m.claude/set[15Gings.local.json[39m:[K[2C[1B- [38;2;177;185;249mPreCompact[39m → [38;2;177;185;249mhook[23Gcompac[30G-packet.sh claude-precompact[39m[K[2C[1B-[5G[38;2;177;185;249mPostCompact[17G[39m→[19G[38;2;177;185;249mhook-compact-packet.sh claude-postcompact[2C[1B[39m[K[2C[1BBoth call [38;2;177;185;249marteries.packet[29G[39mwith[34Gidentical[44Garguments.[55GIt[58Grebuilds[67Gfrom[72Gthe[76Gsame[81Grunlog[88Gand[92Gmemory[99Gstore[105Gseconds[113Gapart,[120Gso[123Gyou[127Gget[131Gtwo[135Gnear-identical[150Gpackets.[159GThe[163Gonly[168Gdifferences[180Gin[183Gyour[188Gpaste[194Gare[198Gthe[202G[38;2;177;185;249mTrigger:[211G[39mline[216Gand[220Gthe[224Gfact[229Gthat[234Gthe[238Gpost[243Gcopy[248Gpicked[2C[1Bup[6Ga[8GPersistent[19GMemory[26Grow[30Gthe[34Gpre[38Gcopy[43Gdidn't[50G(retrieval[61Gran[65Geither[72Gside[77Gof[80Gthe[84Gcompaction[95Gboundary).[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1m2. Neither packet is actually reaching the model[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mhook-compact-packet.sh[27G[39mr[29Gnts[33Gbare markdown[47Gto[50Gstdout.[58GFor Claude Code, [38;2;177;185;249mPreCompact[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mPostCompact[39m stdout is transcript display only — i[136G becomes[145Gcontext[153Gonly[158Gvia[162G[38;2;177;185;249mhookSpecificOutput.additionalContext[39m,[200Gwhich[206Gthis[211Gscript[218Gnever[224Gemits.[231GYour[236Gother[242Ghooks[248Gdo[251Git[2C[1Bcorrectly[13G([38;2;177;185;249marteries-activate.cjs:21[39m),[41Gso[44Gthe[48Gomission[57Gis[60Gspecific[69Gto[72Gthis[77Gone.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BWhat[8Gactually[17Gruns[22Gafter[28Ga[30Gcompaction[41Gis[44G[38;2;177;185;249mSessionStart[