38;2;177;185;249mhookSpecificOutput.additionalContext[39m,[200Gwhich[206Gthis[211Gscript[218Gnever[224Gemits.[231GYour[236Gother[242Ghooks[248Gdo[251Git[2C[1Bcorrectly ([38;2;177;185;249marteries-activate.cjs:21[39m),[41Gso[44Gthe[48Gomission[57Gis[60Gspecific[69Gto[72Gthis[77Gone.[2C[2BWhat actually[17Gruns [23Gfter a c[32Gmpaction is [38;2;177;185;249mSessionStart[39m with matcher [38;2;177;185;249mcompact[39m → [38;2;177;185;249mactivate.sh[93G[39mwhich prints the banner and up to 8 evergreen[139Gfacts. No recent conversation, no memories, no packet. So the con[205Ginuity packet you're reading in the [242Germinal[250Gis[2C[1Bdecorative.[K[2C[2B[1m3. The truncation, and yes it hurts[22m[K[2C[2B[38;2;177;185;249mpacket.py:346[39m allocates 25% of the budget to Recent Conversation.[69GDefault budget[84Gis 6000,[93Gso recent[103Ggets [1m1500 chars[22m.[120GEach pai[129G costs up to[142G1002 ([38;2;177;185;249m_one_line[39m caps Q and A at 500 ea[182G, [38;2;177;185;249mpacket.py:317[39m). Ten [205Gurns need up to ~10,000 chars against a 1500[2C[1Bbudget — you get three pairs, and the thi[45Gd is already clipped. That's[74Gexactly[82Gthe[86G[38;2;177;185;249m[Section truncated to fit budget.][121G[39myou[125Gsaw[129Gafter[135Gturn[140G3.[2C[2B[38;2;177;185;249m_load_recent_pairs[39m genuinely[32Gfetches[40G10.[44GThe[48Gbudget[55Gthrows[62Gaway[67Gseven[73Gof[76Gthem.[2C[2BThere's also a pairing defect visible in your own paste: turn[65G2's[69Gquestion[78G("Can[84Gthere[90Gbe[93Ga[95Gsmaller[103Glocal[109Gmodel...")[120Gis[123Ganswered[132Gwith[137Gtext[142Gabout[148G[38;2;177;185;249mplanning/ontology_design.md[39m,[177Gwhich[183Gbelongs[191Gto[194Ga[196Gdifferent[206Gturn.[212GThat's[219Gthe[223G[38;2;177;185;249mprior_turn[234G[39moffset[241Glogic[247Gat[2C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mpacket.py:292-299[21G[39mattaching[31Gan[34Gassistant[44Gresponse[53Gto[56Gthe[60Gwrong[66Ganchor.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mFixes, cheapest first[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[32m# recent gets 60% instead of 25%; drop the duplicate hook[2C[1B[39m[K[2C[1B-[5GDelete[12Gthe[16G[38;2;177;185;249mPreCompact[27G[39mentry.[34GIts[38Goutput[45Gis[48Gconsumed[57Gby[60Gthe[64Gcompaction[75Git[78Gprecedes[87G—[89Gnothing[97Git[100Gemits[106Gcan[110Gsurvive.[1B [3G- Raise [38;2;177;185;249mARTERIES_PACKET_BUDGET[34G[39min[37G[38;2;177;185;249m.arteries/env[51G[39m(currently[62Gempty)[69Gto[72G~15000,[80Gor[83Greweight[92G[38;2;177;185;249m_allocations[105G[39mtoward[112G[38;2;177;185;249mrecent[39m.[120GAt[123G6000[128Gwith[133Ga[135G0.25[140Gshare,[147Gten[151Gturns[157Gcannot[164Gfit[168Gby[171Gconstruction.[2C[1B-[5GWrap[10Gthe[14Gpacket[21Gin[24G[38;2;177;185;249m{"hookSpecificOutput":{"hookEventName":"SessionStart","additionalContext":...}}[104G[39mand[108Gmove[113Git[116Gonto[121Gthe[125G[38;2;177;185;249mSessionStart[138Gcompact[146G[39mmatcher,[155Gso[158Gthe[162Gthing[168Gyou[172Gbuilt[178Gactually[187Glands[193Gin[196Gcontext.[1B[K[2C[1BWant[8Gme[11Gto[14Gapply[20Gthese?[27GThe[31Gpairing[39Gbug[43Gis[46Ga[48Gseparate,[58Glarger[65Gfix[69G—[71Gsay[75Gthe[79Gword[84Gand[88GI'll[93Gtake[98Git[101Gon[104Gits[108Gown.[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GChurned for 1m 8s[1B[39m[K[1B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mapply all three fixes, including the pairing bug[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                            [1B[49m[K[1B  [38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m8[22m shell commands [39m[K[5C[1B[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mNow the budget allocation and the pairing bug[49Gin[52G[38;2;177;185;249mpacket.